Actual tests must distinguish: one exact package with two transitions/requirement subsets/deadlines; mixed concern+threshold in one episode; two distinct tasks under 004 and exact retry with no third task; shared identical binding dedup; unconfigured extra/wrong rule/definition/task refs; omitted old obligation or weaker reason; two episodes and closure of only the selected generation's task set; an overdue first task retained after later strengthening; pending unsupported threshold item preventing whole clearance. Compare operation/clinical/version deltas independently from task count. All precommit task/event/binding faults must roll back archive cursor, clinical rows, latch, task sets, keys, audit, versions and decision; aftercommit loss must recover original immutable receipt/IDs.

Upgrade proof starts from an actual stopped 003 checkpoint DB with a prior task, task events, review, saved ordinary display and archive bytes. Apply explicit backup/new-volume 004 cutover; prove IDs/FKs/old payload hashes unchanged and new plural task/retry positive. Inject beforecommit and aftercommit process death with new routing off until complete recovery; old worker restart must fail. Exercise unsupported ambiguous old mapping as an unrouted failure. No old migration bytes change.

